-- 007_vera_domain_registry ROLLBACK -- DRAFT, NOT EXECUTED. DESTRUCTIVE: drops the domain registry and every association in it.
-- Filename deliberately does not match apply_migrations.py's `{prefix}_vera_*.sql` glob (N-1); rename only at Approval 1 with an owner-approved applier fix.
-- Requires R1's separate, same-turn approval and an admin account, on an isolated DB only. Run only after an export of the three tables.
